#: ../../api/types/input_sticker.rst:3
msgid "InputSticker"
msgstr ""

#: litegram.types.input_sticker.InputSticker:1 of
msgid "This object describes a sticker to be added to a sticker set."
msgstr ""

#: litegram.types.input_sticker.InputSticker:3 of
msgid "Source: https://core.telegram.org/bots/api#inputsticker"
msgstr ""

#: litegram.types.input_sticker.InputSticker.sticker:1 of
msgid ""
"The added sticker. Pass a *file_id* as a String to send a file that "
"already exists on the Telegram servers, pass an HTTP URL as a String for "
"Telegram to get a file from the Internet, or pass 'attach://' to upload a"
" new file using multipart/form-data under  name. Animated and video "
"stickers can't be uploaded via HTTP URL. :ref:`More information on "
"Sending Files » <sending-files>`"
msgstr ""
"Добавляемый стикер. Передайте *file_id* строкой, чтобы отправить файл, "
"уже находящийся на серверах Telegram; HTTP URL строкой, чтобы Telegram "
"скачал файл из интернета; или 'attach://', чтобы загрузить новый файл "
"через multipart/form-data под этим именем. Анимированные и видео-стикеры "
"нельзя загрузить по HTTP URL. :ref:`Подробнее об отправке файлов "
"<sending-files>`"

#: litegram.types.input_sticker.InputSticker.format:1 of
msgid ""
"Format of the added sticker, must be one of 'static' for a **.WEBP** or "
"**.PNG** image, 'animated' for a **.TGS** animation, 'video' for a "
"**.WEBM** video"
msgstr ""

#: litegram.types.input_sticker.InputSticker.emoji_list:1 of
msgid "List of 1-20 emoji associated with the sticker"
msgstr ""

#: litegram.types.input_sticker.InputSticker.mask_position:1 of
msgid ""
"*Optional*. Position where the mask should be placed on faces. For 'mask'"
" stickers only."
msgstr ""

#: litegram.types.input_sticker.InputSticker.keywords:1 of
msgid ""
"*Optional*. List of 0-20 search keywords for the sticker with total "
"length of up to 64 characters. For 'regular' and 'custom_emoji' stickers "
"only."
msgstr ""

